sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as API
  participant D as SQLite
  B->>A: POST /api/auth/register {name,email,password} + X-BillKit-CSRF
  A->>A: zod validation · Argon2id hash (m=19MiB,t=2)
  A->>D: INSERT user
  A->>D: INSERT session(id = sha256(random 256-bit token))
  A-->>B: Set-Cookie bk_session (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Secure in prod)
  B->>A: GET /api/bills (cookie)
  A->>D: lookup sha256(token) → user (expiry check)
  A->>D: SELECT … WHERE user_id = ?
  A-->>B: only this user's data
  B->>A: POST /api/auth/forgot-password
  A->>D: store sha256(reset token), 30-min expiry
  A-->>B: same response whether account exists or not
  Note over A: email via SMTP if configured
  B->>A: POST /api/auth/reset-password {token,password}
  A->>D: mark token used · delete all sessions · update hash
